ass=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257690/extras/41df994825563798914db402481083eb.poster.avif?t=1746728661\" width=608 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257690/extras/41df994825563798914db402481083eb.webm?t=1746728661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257690/extras/41df994825563798914db402481083eb.mp4?t=1746728661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EMBRACE A FULL-ACTION HORROR EXPERIENCE</h2><br>Some of the Key Features are: <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Advanced IK<br></li><li>Physical animations<br></li><li>Dismemberment system<br></li><li>Destructible environment and more</li></ul>",
